{"text":"kuruntokai","n":209,"lines":["அறந்தலைப் பட்ட நெல்லியம் பசுங்காய்","மறப்புலிக் குருளை கோளிடங் கறங்கும்","இறப்பருங் குன்ற மிறந்த யாமே","குறுநடை பலவுள் ளலமே நெறிமுதற்","கடற்றிற் கலித்த முடச்சினை வெட்சி","தளையவிழ் பல்போது கமழும்","மையிருங் கூந்தன் மடந்தை நட்பே"],"tr":["aṟantalaip paṭṭa nelliyam pacuṅkāy","maṟappulik kuruḷai kōḷiṭaṅ kaṟaṅkum","iṟapparuṅ kuṉṟa miṟanta yāmē","kuṟunaṭai palavuḷ ḷalamē neṟimutaṟ","kaṭaṟṟiṟ kalitta muṭacciṉai veṭci","taḷaiyaviḻ palpōtu kamaḻum","maiyiruṅ kūntaṉ maṭantai naṭpē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"பாலைபாடிய பெருங்கடுங்கோ","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Pālaipāṭiya Peruṅkaṭuṅkō"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 26, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 15, āciriyattaḷai 10, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அறந்தலைப்","tr":"aṟantalaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அறந்","tr":"aṟan"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலைப்","tr":"talaip"}]},{"text":"பட்ட","tr":"paṭṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பட்","tr":"paṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"நெல்லியம்","tr":"nelliyam","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெல்","tr":"nel"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லியம்","tr":"liyam"}]},{"text":"பசுங்காய்","tr":"pacuṅkāy","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பசுங்","tr":"pacuṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"காய்","tr":"kāy"}]}],[{"text":"மறப்புலிக்","tr":"maṟappulik","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மறப்","tr":"maṟap"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புலிக்","tr":"pulik"}]},{"text":"குருளை","tr":"kuruḷai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குரு","tr":"kuru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளை","tr":"ḷai"}]},{"text":"கோளிடங்","tr":"kōḷiṭaṅ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோ","tr":"kō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளிடங்","tr":"ḷiṭaṅ"}]},{"text":"கறங்கும்","tr":"kaṟaṅkum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கறங்","tr":"kaṟaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]}],[{"text":"இறப்பருங்","tr":"iṟapparuṅ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இறப்","tr":"iṟap"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பருங்","tr":"paruṅ"}]},{"text":"குன்ற","tr":"kuṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குன்","tr":"kuṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"மிறந்த","tr":"miṟanta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிறந்","tr":"miṟan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"யாமே","tr":"yāmē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"}]}],[{"text":"குறுநடை","tr":"kuṟunaṭai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குறு","tr":"kuṟu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நடை","tr":"naṭai"}]},{"text":"பலவுள்","tr":"palavuḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வுள்","tr":"vuḷ"}]},{"text":"ளலமே","tr":"ḷalamē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளல","tr":"ḷala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"}]},{"text":"நெறிமுதற்","tr":"neṟimutaṟ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெறி","tr":"neṟi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முதற்","tr":"mutaṟ"}]}],[{"text":"கடற்றிற்","tr":"kaṭaṟṟiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடற்","tr":"kaṭaṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றிற்","tr":"ṟiṟ"}]},{"text":"கலித்த","tr":"kalitta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலித்","tr":"kalit"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"முடச்சினை","tr":"muṭacciṉai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முடச்","tr":"muṭac"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சினை","tr":"ciṉai"}]},{"text":"வெட்சி","tr":"veṭci","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெட்","tr":"veṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சி","tr":"ci"}]}],[{"text":"தளையவிழ்","tr":"taḷaiyaviḻ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தளை","tr":"taḷai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யவிழ்","tr":"yaviḻ"}]},{"text":"பல்போது","tr":"palpōtu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பல்","tr":"pal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"கமழும்","tr":"kamaḻum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கம","tr":"kama"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழும்","tr":"ḻum"}]}],[{"text":"மையிருங்","tr":"maiyiruṅ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிருங்","tr":"yiruṅ"}]},{"text":"கூந்தன்","tr":"kūntaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூந்","tr":"kūn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"}]},{"text":"மடந்தை","tr":"maṭantai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மடந்","tr":"maṭan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"}]},{"text":"நட்பே","tr":"naṭpē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நட்","tr":"naṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அறம்","parts":[{"text":"அறம்","lemma":"aṟam","gloss":"nature"}],"gloss":"nature"},{"surface":"தலைப்பட்ட","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"head"},{"text":"பட்ட","lemma":"paṭṭa","gloss":"attained"}],"gloss":"attained"},{"surface":"நெல்லியம்","parts":[{"text":"நெல்லி","lemma":"nelli","gloss":"gooseberry"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"euphonic increment"}],"gloss":"of gooseberry"},{"surface":"பசுங்காய்","parts":[{"text":"பசுமை","lemma":"pacumai","gloss":"greenness"},{"text":"காய்","lemma":"kāy","gloss":"unripe fruit"}],"gloss":"green unripe fruit"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறப்புலி","parts":[{"text":"மறப்புலி","lemma":"மறப்புலி","gloss":"fierce tiger"}],"gloss":"fierce tiger","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குருளை","parts":[{"text":"குருளை","lemma":"kuruḷai","gloss":"cub"}],"gloss":"cub"},{"surface":"கோளிடம்","parts":[{"text":"கோள்","lemma":"kōḷ","gloss":"taking"},{"text":"இடம்","lemma":"iṭam","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"playing place"},{"surface":"கறங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"கறங்கு","lemma":"kaṟaṅku","gloss":"spin"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"spinning"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இறப்பு","parts":[{"text":"இறப்பு","lemma":"iṟappu","gloss":"passing"}],"gloss":"passing"},{"surface":"அருமை","parts":[{"text":"அருமை","lemma":"arumai","gloss":"difficulty"}],"gloss":"difficult"},{"surface":"குன்றம்","parts":[{"text":"குன்றம்","lemma":"kuṉṟam","gloss":"hill"}],"gloss":"hills"},{"surface":"இறந்த","parts":[{"text":"இறந்த","lemma":"iṟanta","gloss":"crossed"}],"gloss":"crossed"},{"surface":"யாமே","parts":[{"text":"யாம்","lemma":"yām","gloss":"we"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"we indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குறுநடை","parts":[{"text":"குறுமை","lemma":"kuṟumai","gloss":"shortness"},{"text":"நடை","lemma":"naṭai","gloss":"gait"}],"gloss":"short steps"},{"surface":"பல","parts":[{"text":"பல","lemma":"pala","gloss":"many"}],"gloss":"many"},{"surface":"உள்ளலமே","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளு","lemma":"uḷḷu","gloss":"think"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"al","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"we"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"we do not think of indeed"},{"surface":"நெறிமுதல்","parts":[{"text":"நெறி","lemma":"neṟi","gloss":"path"},{"text":"முதல்","lemma":"mutal","gloss":"beginning"}],"gloss":"at the beginning of the path"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடற்றின்","parts":[{"text":"கடற்றின்","lemma":"கடற்றின்","gloss":"in the desert"}],"gloss":"in the desert","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கலித்த","parts":[{"text":"கலி","lemma":"kali","gloss":"thrive"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"tta","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"thrived"},{"surface":"முடச்சினை","parts":[{"text":"முடச்சினை","lemma":"முடச்சினை","gloss":"crooked-branched"}],"gloss":"crooked-branched","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வெட்சி","parts":[{"text":"வெட்சி","lemma":"veṭci","gloss":"scarlet ixora"}],"gloss":"scarlet ixora"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தளையவிழ்","parts":[{"text":"தளை","lemma":"taḷai","gloss":"bud"},{"text":"அவிழ்","lemma":"aviḻ","gloss":"unfold"}],"gloss":"bud-unfolded"},{"surface":"பல்போது","parts":[{"text":"பல்போது","lemma":"பல்போது","gloss":"many flowers"}],"gloss":"many flowers","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கமழும்","parts":[{"text":"கமழ்","lemma":"kamaḻ","gloss":"fragrance"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"fragrance-emitting"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மையிருங்","parts":[{"text":"மையிருங்","lemma":"மையிருங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கூந்தன்","parts":[{"text":"கூந்தன்","lemma":"கூந்தன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மடந்தை","parts":[{"text":"மடந்தை","lemma":"மடந்தை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நட்பே","parts":[{"text":"நட்பே","lemma":"நட்பே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Nature-attained gooseberry's green unripe fruit, / fierce tiger's cub, as a toy, spinning, / the difficult-to-cross hills, we crossed; / short steps, many, we do not think of indeed; at the beginning of the path, / in the desert, thrived crooked-branched scarlet ixora's / bud-unfolded many flowers' fragrance-emitting / dark black hair-possessing young woman's friendship indeed.","translation":"We have crossed the difficult hills where the naturally fallen green gooseberries spin as playthings for the cubs of the fierce tiger. Yet, we do not think of the many weary short steps we had to take, because our minds are filled with the friendship of the young woman with dark black hair, which is as fragrant as the many opening buds of the crooked-branched Veᅡci that thrives in the desert at the start of the path.","modern":"இயற்கையாக ஁தர்ந்த தெல்லி மரத்தின் பசல் காய்கள், காடிய புலிக்குட்டிகள் விலைடாடி உருட்டு૥ இடமாக விலங்கு૥, கடப்பத்கரிய மலைகளைக் கடத்து வல்த நா૥, அந்த வழியில் நடந்த பல சிறிய அடிகளின் வருத்தத்தை நினைக்கவே மாட்டு૥; ஏனெனில், வழியின் தொடக்கத்தில் உள்ள காட்டில் தழைத்த, வளைந்த கிலைகளையுடைய வெட்சி மரத்தின் இதழ் அவிழ்த்த பல மலல்களின் நறுமண் க૥ழு૥, கரிிய கூந்தலையுடைய தலைவியின் நட்பையே நா૥ நினைத்துக் கொண்டிருக்கிறுா૥.","explanation":"The hero is speaking to himself or his companion after crossing a difficult desert path to return to his beloved. He describes the harsh landscape where fierce tiger cubs play by rolling fallen green gooseberries. Despite the arduous journey, he declares that he does not feel the fatigue of the many short steps he had to take. This is because his mind is entirely occupied by the sweet memory of his beloved's love. Her dark hair is as fragrant as the freshly opened Veᅡci flowers growing at the entrance of the desert path, showing how her love sustains him through all hardships.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.78],[0.78,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,1.5],[1.5,2.9],[2.98,3.31],[3.31,3.47],[3.47,4.2],[4.2,4.7],[4.7,5.13],[5.13,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.9,7.0],[7.0,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.9],[7.9,7.9],[7.9,7.9],[7.9,10.7],[10.7,11.8],[11.8,12.3],[12.3,12.4],[12.4,13.4],[13.4,13.8],[13.8,13.8],[13.8,14.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.78],[0.78,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,1.6],[1.6,1.79],[1.79,2.57],[2.57,2.96],[2.96,4.51],[4.51,4.7],[4.7,5.77],[5.77,6.5],[6.5,6.9],[6.9,8.19],[8.19,8.83],[8.83,8.83],[8.83,8.83],[8.83,8.83],[8.83,11.41],[12.85,12.93],[12.93,12.93],[12.93,13.0],[13.0,13.5],[13.5,13.6],[13.6,15.0],[15.0,15.4],[15.4,15.5],[15.5,16.0]]}}